descriptionByLocale.en:
Active in Western Switzerland, we help our customers to carry out their projects by providing comprehensive, efficient and sustainable energy solutions, whether in the production and distribution of electricity and heat, electrical installations, home automation, soft mobility, air conditioning or water treatment. As an exemplary employer, we support the development of the skills of our 2450 employees, including 245 apprentices, and the reconciliation between private and professional life. Thanks to efficient and innovative solutions, the Celsius Directorate specialises in the production, supply and distribution of renewable heat and natural gas, the company now operates some 50 remote heating networks. Mission:
• Monitoring and quality of installation of remote heating networks;
• Ensuring customer satisfaction and achieving the technical and financial objectives of the projects;
• Ensure support in the organisation and supervision of construction sites and in the delivery and control of goods;
• Ensure site safety;
• Plan and coordinate the activities of subcontractors as work progresses. Profile:
• Basic training in the building, supplemented by the diploma of ES Technician in the conduct of works – or training deemed equivalent;
• Experience in the conduct of works or project management, as well as in the remediation of sewage or drinking water systems;
• Good knowledge of the various actors involved in construction;
• Organizational sense, initiative and ease of contact. What we offer:
• An evolving environment conducive to work-life balance.
• Social benefits of a modern enterprise, fair treatment, opportunities for professional development.
• A strong spirit of cohesion and a team proud to collaborate: "Together, we are moving towards success." Need more information? Contact Tiago Poroes, Head of Civil Engineering at 026 352 68 81. Interested? We look forward to receiving your full application by clicking on the "Post" button below. Human resources Brice Muller Apply » Search for similar jobs: Unsere offene Stellen, Vacancy
